Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.42,0:00:45.22,Note,0,0,0,0,,（科罗拉多州 曲水联邦监狱）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.22,0:01:00.62,Note,0,0,0,0,,（耶和华说 你弃绝了我）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.77,0:02:30.50,Title,0,0,0,0,,《金蝉脱壳》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.85,0:02:35.52,Note,0,0,0,0,,（禁闭室 曲水联邦监狱 隔离区）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.40,0:05:40.10,Note,0,0,0,0,,（巧克力牛奶）
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.40,0:07:33.95,Note,0,0,0,0,,（圣经）
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.64,0:07:57.64,Note,0,0,0,0,,（幸运的雷）
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.50,0:15:46.51,Note,0,0,0,0,,（加利福尼亚州 洛杉矶）
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.80,0:15:48.82,Note,0,0,0,0,,（BC安保公司）
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.56,0:19:54.16,Note,0,0,0,0,,（路易斯安那州 新奥尔良）
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.03,0:29:48.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是萨拉姆
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.30,0:35:55.60,Note,0,0,0,0,,（破解监狱安防系统 雷·布雷斯林著）
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.87,0:52:42.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能听见你
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.47,0:52:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这头猪
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.24,0:52:52.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能听见你
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.73,0:52:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会把你们杀光
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.87,0:52:57.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要把你的眼珠子挖出来
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.92,0:53:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要阉了你
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.45,0:53:08.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 你等着 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.13,0:53:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.08,0:53:16.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我受不了黑暗
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.73,0:53:18.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.32,0:53:32.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝宽恕我
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.78,0:53:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在天上的父
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.51,0:53:35.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿人都尊你的名为圣
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.88,0:53:37.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿你的国降临
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.46,0:53:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿你的旨意行在地上如同行在天上
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.10,0:53:41.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们日用的饮食 今日赐给我们
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.24,0:53:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,宽恕我们的罪过 如同我们宽恕别人一样
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.00,0:53:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要让我陷于诱惑
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.50,0:53:49.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,但救我们脱离凶恶
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.30,0:53:56.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你凶恶 你是魔鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.73,0:54:13.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听说过有个疯子
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.11,0:54:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,大白天提着灯笼
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.35,0:54:18.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑到集市上
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.35,0:54:23.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不断地喊 我找上帝
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.28,0:54:24.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找上帝
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.60,1:01:28.90,Note,0,0,0,0,,（检索中央情报局数据库 密码无效）
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.20,1:07:15.10,Note,0,0,0,0,,（止血粉）
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.56,1:15:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,真主 宽恕我
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.62,1:17:55.20,Note,0,0,0,0,,（摩洛哥）
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.13,1:19:30.00,Note,0,0,0,0,,（希波克拉底誓言）
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.80,1:19:34.60,Note,0,0,0,0,,（医学伦理）
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.69,1:22:44.36,Note,0,0,0,0,,（C区转移时发动暴乱）
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.06,1:22:50.25,Note,0,0,0,0,,（24小时内赶到）
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.25,1:22:51.25,Note,0,0,0,0,,（北纬30度22分 西经23度6分）
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.25,1:22:52.31,Note,0,0,0,0,,（明天下午5点整 烧烤泳池派对）
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.09,1:22:56.99,Note,0,0,0,0,,（记住告诉孩子们）
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.29,1:22:59.81,Note,0,0,0,0,,（带上所有玩具）
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.81,1:23:01.27,Note,0,0,0,0,,（洛特梅耶）
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.09,1:27:11.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,启动封锁程序
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.76,1:31:41.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们究竟在找什么 长官
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.21,1:33:34.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,真主至大
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.90,1:35:13.90,Note,0,0,0,0,,（确认关闭电源）
Dialogue: 0,1:35:13.90,1:35:14.40,Note,0,0,0,0,,（关闭）
Dialogue: 0,1:36:47.70,1:36:49.50,Note,0,0,0,0,,（水燃料转换系统）
Dialogue: 0,1:39:41.25,1:39:43.44,Note,0,0,0,0,,（重启系统 冲洗水箱）
Dialogue: 0,1:39:50.80,1:39:51.80,Note,0,0,0,0,,（重启系统 冲洗水箱）
Dialogue: 0,1:41:26.50,1:41:27.50,Note,0,0,0,0,,（易燃品）
Dialogue: 0,1:42:15.34,1:42:19.60,Note,0,0,0,0,,（摩洛哥海岸 距西迪伊夫尼以南10公里）
Dialogue: 0,1:45:44.63,1:45:45.17,Note,0,0,0,0,,（营利性非法监狱大曝光）
Dialogue: 0,1:46:03.31,1:46:05.63,Note,0,0,0,0,,（佛罗里达州 迈阿密）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.21,0:01:28.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 你醒了 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yo, are you up? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.67,0:01:30.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克斯明天会先动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jax has got the jump on you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.30,0:01:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,两点钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two bell.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.38,0:01:36.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,算是还你人情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I figure I owe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.14,0:01:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 听见了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo. Did you hear what I said?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.14,0:01:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,听见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.11,0:01:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.13,0:02:15.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人都趴下 快 趴在地上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody down now! On the ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.51,0:02:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 犯人 趴在地上\N{\fnArial\fs30}You! Inmate! On the ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.97,0:02:21.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Down!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.35,0:02:24.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 趴下 - 听见了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get down! - You heard him!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.64,0:02:26.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我趴下\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the fucking ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.88,0:02:53.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,该你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.67,0:02:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,左转\N{\fnArial\fs30}To your left.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.05,0:03:01.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,站在线上\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.48,0:03:10.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.90,0:03:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,站在右边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Step to the right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.74,0:03:26.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,进去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.25,0:03:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.84,0:03:42.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好享受\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enjoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.99,0:04:50.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠着墙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Against the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.16,0:04:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.54,0:05:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃午饭了 犯人 吃点素的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lunchtime, inmate. Eat your veggies.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.80,0:05:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.38,0:05:47.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 罗格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Roag!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.55,0:05:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.97,0:05:50.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在几点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got the time?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.06,0:05:53.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,管这干嘛 要去约会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck you care? You got a date?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.22,0:05:54.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.64,0:05:57.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不把你妹妹介绍给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you got a sister or a cousin?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.40,0:06:00.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想找揍吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wanna get your head smashed?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.73,0:06:02.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不想\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.23,0:06:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,差5分4点\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's five to 4:00.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.32,0:06:08.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,自作聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wise ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.16,0:06:16.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 基佬 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Fruitcake! Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.87,0:06:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,2 3 4\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two… Three… Four…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.25,0:06:27.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,5 6 7\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five… Six… Seven…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.22,0:06:29.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,8\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eight…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.59,0:06:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,9\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nine…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.18,0:06:33.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,10\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ten…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.69,0:06:42.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,290 291\N{\fnArial\fs30}290… 291…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.40,0:06:46.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,292 293\N{\fnArial\fs30}292… 293…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.53,0:06:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,294\N{\fnArial\fs30}294…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.53,0:06:52.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,295 296\N{\fnArial\fs30}295… 296…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.12,0:06:55.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,297 298\N{\fnArial\fs30}297… 298…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.29,0:06:59.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,299 300\N{\fnArial\fs30}299… 300.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.88,0:07:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.96,0:07:06.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.86,0:07:25.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底出了什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.40,0:07:28.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,2号门发生火灾 让所有犯人都回到牢房里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got a fire, gate two. All prisoners back to their cells.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.28,0:07:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.99,0:07:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.08,0:07:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人跑了 重复 有犯人跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got a runner! Repeat, prisoner is running!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.58,0:07:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.52,0:08:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,绕行不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice look.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.02,0:08:06.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,是哈什的主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hush's idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.36,0:08:08.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.19,0:08:09.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面怎么样啊 头儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}How was inside, boss man?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.53,0:08:12.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,棒极了 大家都问你好呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inside's great. Everyone's asking about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.32,0:08:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要是再不出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you weren't out soon,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.51,0:08:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就会冲进去把你给拎出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd be breaking into that motherfucker and pulling your ass out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.95,0:08:19.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是头一个出来了还想再进去的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only ex-con I know gets out, wants to go back in.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.00,0:08:22.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没说我想 我说我会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't say "wants." I said I would.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.87,0:08:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可有区别\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is a difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.31,0:08:49.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可省着点用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't spend it all in one place.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.99,0:09:03.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们找到一名从曲水监狱越狱出来的犯人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have an escape from Bendwater Penitentiary.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.93,0:09:21.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,举起手来 从电话亭里走出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Step out of the booth with your hands in the air!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.85,0:09:23.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好戏开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Showtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.10,0:09:28.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,把手举起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put your hands in the air! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.36,0:09:30.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把手举起来 - 把手放在脑后\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get them up, now! - Hands in the air!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.94,0:09:35.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,十指交叉 不许动 听到吗 举起手来 不许动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put your hands on your head! Interlock your fingers! Do not move!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.78,0:09:38.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,天气真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beautiful day.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.27,0:10:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是莱斯特·克拉克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calm down, Warden. I'm Lester Clark.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.65,0:10:13.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是BC安保公司的首席执行官\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the CEO of B&C Security.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.65,0:10:16.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,听说过我们吧 没有？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might have heard of us. No?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.82,0:10:21.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们是一家独立的安保公司\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well… We're an independent security company.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.16,0:10:24.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,联邦监狱局雇佣我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}hired by the Federal Bureau of Prisons.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.62,0:10:31.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,测试他们在全国范围内 高度戒备的监狱的可靠性\N{\fnArial\fs30}to test the integrity of their maximum security facilities nationwide.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.25,0:10:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位是雷·布雷斯林 他是我的合伙人\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Ray Breslin. He's my partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.41,0:10:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,同时 也是逃脱大师\N{\fnArial\fs30}and resident Houdini.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.93,0:10:39.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,监狱长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Warden.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.09,0:10:44.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去七年里 雷被安插在联邦监狱局管辖的\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the last seven years, Ray has been inserted into.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.22,0:10:48.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,全国每一个高度戒备的监狱里\N{\fnArial\fs30}every maximum incarceration facility in the system.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.27,0:10:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的工作是确保这些监狱里的犯人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is there to ensure that each and every one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.15,0:10:54.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,百分之百无法逃脱\N{\fnArial\fs30}is 100% escape-proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.36,0:10:59.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然你们的监狱不够牢靠 他逃出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And apparently yours wasn't, and he got out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.57,0:11:03.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.37,0:11:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要说说是怎么做到的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose you're gonna tell me how you did it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.00,0:11:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,还以为他很想知道 我自作多情了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think he wants to know? Doesn't seem like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.46,0:11:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷 你就说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ray, you're on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.88,0:11:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,监狱长 我们从头说起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Warden, let's start from the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.80,0:11:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,要越狱得具备三个条件 知道监狱布局\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any break requires three things, knowing the layout,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.89,0:11:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,摸清日常规律 还得有里应或者外合\N{\fnArial\fs30}understanding the routine, and help from outside or in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.18,0:11:30.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,了解监狱布局 薄弱点就会明显\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you know the layout, the weak side is obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.39,0:11:33.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,曲水监狱的薄弱点是禁闭室\N{\fnArial\fs30}In Bendwater's case, it's the Secure Housing Unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.73,0:11:37.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,政府花费了1700万造这座监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}The government expenditure was 17 million dollars building that facility.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.90,0:11:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,用了最先进的技术\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's state-of-the-art.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.70,0:11:45.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一的问题是 它紧挨着一个毫无防范的消防车库\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only problem is, it's located next to an unsecured fire garage.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.83,0:11:52.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先我要进入禁闭室 所以我树了些敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}First I needed to get inside, so I made some enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.38,0:11:58.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,进去后我发现那儿明显人手不足\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once inside, it was obvious you were short-staffed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.17,0:12:00.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,联邦政策建议在押送高风险犯人的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Federal guidelines recommend two guards are present.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.67,0:12:04.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,要有两名狱警 你们只用了一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}when transferring high risk inmates. You only use one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.34,0:12:06.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一步是摸清狱警的活动规律\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knowing the guards' routine was the next step.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.22,0:12:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次放风30秒 看管的狱警会去抽烟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thirty seconds into my rec time, my CO took a smoke break.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.44,0:12:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,每天有7分钟 没有人监视我\N{\fnArial\fs30}For seven minutes every day, there were no eyes on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.11,0:12:16.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,2\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.61,0:12:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,3\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.69,0:12:21.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦摸清了规律 我要做的就是挑个日子\N{\fnArial\fs30}After I knew the routine, all I had to do was pick the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.24,0:12:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,可那个时候你还被关在禁闭室里\N{\fnArial\fs30}But at this point, you were still locked inside a steel box.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.29,0:12:31.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,要出来 你得有门的密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}To get out, you had to have a key code.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.46,0:12:34.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的巧克力牛奶很不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have very good chocolate milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.46,0:12:40.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,牛奶盒内侧有一层薄薄的蜡片\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, the cartons contain a thin layer of wax laminate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.43,0:12:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它盖在键盘上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lay it over the keypad,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.72,0:12:50.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,留下的指印会显示哪四个键被按过\N{\fnArial\fs30}the impression will indicate which four keys were pressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.45,0:13:07.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,有了这四个数字 剩下的就是排列组合的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}With the four keys, it's just a numbers game to identify the correct sequence.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.66,0:13:09.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只要摸到键盘就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just needed to get to the keypad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.85,0:13:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,删掉监控录像 我有1分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Afterl covered my tracks, I had one minute to make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.39,0:13:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,在消防队之前赶到消防车库\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the fire response shed before the team did.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.70,0:13:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道狱警那会儿还在屋顶上浪费时间呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew the guards were still on the roof doing what they do, which is wasting time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.62,0:13:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.71,0:13:57.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你们发现之前我已经出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And before you know it, I'm right where I want to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.34,0:14:10.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,正好赶上搭顺风车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just in time to catch my ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.19,0:14:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的消防队把我送出大门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then your men drove me right off the grounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.90,0:14:24.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有问题吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have any questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.07,0:14:35.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么样的人会愿意没事整天待在监狱里\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of man would choose to spend most of his life in prison?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.25,0:14:37.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是针对你个人 监狱长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't take it personally, Warden.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.17,0:14:42.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些年 雷从14座监狱里逃脱出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over the years, Ray has broken out of 14 of these institutions.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.75,0:14:46.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些人擅长画画 有些人呢 擅长唱歌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some people have a talent to paint, some to sing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.67,0:14:47.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很会唱歌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me, I sing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.59,0:14:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷·布雷斯林拥有一项独特的技能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ray Breslin, he possesses a unique set of skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.89,0:14:55.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,凡是人设计出来的监狱 他都能逃出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is able to break out of any prison designed by man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.43,0:14:58.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最近规矩吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So have you been good?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.94,0:15:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 你呢 在里面听话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. You? You a good boy inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.40,0:15:02.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.40,0:15:06.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 跟那个男的处得怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay… How did that thing with that guy go?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.94,0:15:08.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哪个男的 - 哪个男的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What guy? - What guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.74,0:15:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我进去的时候 你准备跟一个笨蛋共进晚餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I was going in, you were about to have dinner with some guy, some bozo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.03,0:15:14.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 那个 甜点还没上我们就崩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah. That bozo ended before dessert.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.37,0:15:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他没眼光\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's his loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.62,0:15:19.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 一群窝囊废\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. They're all losers.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.37,0:15:22.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是早就说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many times have I told you that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.96,0:15:25.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,回去想吃点什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to get something to eat when we get back?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.30,0:15:28.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.14,0:15:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的厨艺很糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a horrible cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.72,0:15:38.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,真会说话 还是明天早上再抱怨吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's nice. Well, you can complain in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.48,0:15:40.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ouch.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.82,0:15:50.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上好 先生 有事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morning, sir. How can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.32,0:15:56.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 布雷斯林先生 对不起 我是朱丽丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Breslin, I'm so sorry. I'm Jules.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.66,0:15:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 你是新来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's okay. You're new here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.66,0:16:01.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我已经在这儿五个月了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, sir. I've been here five months.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.62,0:16:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 五个月 - 是的 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Five months? - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.75,0:16:08.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要给我看什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you got for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.13,0:16:10.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧瞧这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.01,0:16:15.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错 很聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's good. Very smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.85,0:16:20.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这都是你自己做的？太棒了 天才\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you do this all by yourself? I'm impressed. Genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.52,0:16:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很聪明 不过…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're smart, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.94,0:16:26.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 聪明还不够\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, not smart enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.15,0:16:29.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,别郁闷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be bitter.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.71,0:16:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,布雷斯林先生 大家在会议室等你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Breslin, they're ready for you in the conference room.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.39,0:16:57.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上好 赖斯 艾碧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morning, Les. Abby.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.14,0:17:00.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰西卡·梅耶 很荣幸见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jessica Mayer. It's an honor to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.41,0:17:02.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你代表了这个领域的最高水平\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your work is the gold standard in the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.18,0:17:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你取得的成就太了不起了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you've accomplished is remarkable.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.77,0:17:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 你来这儿为了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. And you're here because…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.48,0:17:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷 她是搞情报工作的 是\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's Agency, Ray. As in…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.32,0:17:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,中央情报局的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Central Intelligence Agency.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.07,0:17:16.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是间谍\N{\fnArial\fs30}You a SPY?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.20,0:17:18.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,更糟 我是个律师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Worse. I'm a lawyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.41,0:17:24.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷 好好听她说 她是真的 我跟他们总部确认过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ray, hear her out. She's legit. I called Langley myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.25,0:17:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我洗耳恭听 说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine. I'll just listen. Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.34,0:17:33.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,布雷斯林先生 非常规引渡被禁止使用以后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Breslin, after ending "extraordinary rendition, " the Agency is looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.42,0:17:36.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,中央情报局一直在寻找另一种方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}alternate situations for incarcerating the sort of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.43,0:17:39.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,来监禁那些犯下严重罪行的人 哦 怎么说好呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}who commit acts so despicable they're best… Well, how can I put it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.39,0:17:41.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,消灭掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eliminated?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.43,0:17:45.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们消失 我们在试验一个样板\N{\fnArial\fs30}Disappeared. And we're currently testing a prototype.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.56,0:17:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,专门接收没有政府愿意要的犯人\N{\fnArial\fs30}to deal with people no government wants on their books.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.61,0:17:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些设施是牢不可逃的\N{\fnArial\fs30}these facilities are escape-proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.57,0:17:55.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,才能在全球范围内推广\N{\fnArial\fs30}before the whole system goes online globally.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.95,0:17:59.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的意思是 这玩意儿目前还没有任何官方认可\N{\fnArial\fs30}What she's really saying is that none of this is officially sanctioned by anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.07,0:18:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,差不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Close.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.24,0:18:02.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗斯小姐 我想说的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I'm saying, Miss Ross,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.45,0:18:06.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种监狱都是私人出资和管理的\N{\fnArial\fs30}is that these facilities are privately funded and administered.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.29,0:18:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以官方这个词其实不适用\N{\fnArial\fs30}So the word "official" does not really apply.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.58,0:18:09.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是说万一出了什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if anything goes wrong,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.67,0:18:11.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们局里也不会扯上关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}nothing comes back to bite you people in the ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.75,0:18:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 这不是你关心的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not your concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.09,0:18:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 我欠他的 不欠你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! I owe him. I don't owe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.43,0:18:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的工作是排除我们国家的一切安全隐患\N{\fnArial\fs30}Myjob is to make sure the United States is safe and clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.30,0:18:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了 别玩虚的了 实话实说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, can we just cut the crap and call it like it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.89,0:18:27.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些机构不受体制约束 没审判 没定罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}These institutions are off the grid. There are no trials, there's no convictions.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.14,0:18:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些人就这么消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}These people are just disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.31,0:18:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你想让他去测试一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you want him to go in and test it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.48,0:18:36.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,说到这会儿 请允许我插个嘴 他们愿意支付\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it's time for me to interject into the conversation that they have offered.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.15,0:18:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,双倍的费用 也就是500万 提前支付\N{\fnArial\fs30}double your standard fee, that's five mil, right? In advance.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.07,0:18:41.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你感兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.62,0:18:44.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 你是艺术家 我是个商人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I'm a numbers guy. You're the artist, Ray.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.58,0:18:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,从经济效益的角度来说 是的 我非常感兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}From a financial standpoint, I like it. Yes, I like it very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.46,0:18:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了钱 布雷斯林先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beyond the money, Mr. Breslin,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.79,0:18:53.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,被关进这个地方的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}the people that are sent to this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.34,0:18:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不应该再出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}should not be allowed out into the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.84,0:18:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们中任何一个都有翻天覆地的本事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every one of them is a potential game changer. For the worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.80,0:19:00.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.39,0:19:06.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,行动指南？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guidelines?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.52,0:19:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,和平时一样 假名字 假身世 联系人 撤离密码 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The usual. Full work. Alias. Cover story. Contact. Evac number. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.85,0:19:14.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一的区别是 为了能彻底测试那里的安全体系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the only difference is to fully test the security of the system.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.69,0:19:17.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能告诉你们中的任何人那里的位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's essential that none of you know the location of the incarceration.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.03,0:19:20.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个会有问题吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will that present a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.57,0:19:21.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,会 当然会有问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Yes, it would.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.92,0:19:33.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么时候开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}When do we start?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.54,0:19:34.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wejust did.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.71,0:19:41.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你换上新身份 从现在起再过24小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and your new identity will be picked up from this location.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.30,0:19:44.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,会有私人保镖在这个地方把你接走\N{\fnArial\fs30}by private contractors 24 hours from now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.91,0:20:04.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我讨厌这任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.07,0:20:06.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你讨厌那姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you don't like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.20,0:20:07.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,别自作多情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't flatter yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.95,0:20:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这次违背了以往你每次进去时\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going against every protocol and guideline.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.54,0:20:15.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,都严格遵循的规程和行动指南\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you yourself have insisted on every single time that you've gone in.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.38,0:20:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我讨厌她\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I don't like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.59,0:20:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得对 这活一点也不招人喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right. There's nothing to like about any of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.50,0:20:21.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那干嘛还干？- 因为他野心大 又贪心\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Then why do it? - Because he's ambitious and greedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.51,0:20:24.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,被你说得跟缺点似的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You say that like it's a bad thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.26,0:20:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}Profile.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.96,0:20:27.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,Ok\N{\fnArial\fs30}好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.97,0:20:32.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,姓名安东尼·普尔图斯 生在马德里 13岁时母亲去世\N{\fnArial\fs30}Name, Anthony Portos. Born Madrid. Mother died when you were 13.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.73,0:20:35.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父亲在美国把你带大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Raised by your father in the U.S.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.69,0:20:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是一名制造炸弹的嫌疑犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were suspected of manufacturing bombs that have been used.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.40,0:20:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,欧洲和南美有12起政治爆炸案用的是你造的炸弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}in a dozen political bombings across Europe and South America.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.57,0:20:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,在过去十年里\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the last 10 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.28,0:20:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面的联系人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Contact on site?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.07,0:20:47.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,监狱长叫罗杰·马什\N{\fnArial\fs30}Warden's name is Roger Marsh.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.20,0:20:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,撤离密码？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evacuation code?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.28,0:20:49.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,310275\N{\fnArial\fs30}3-1-0-2-7-5.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.21,0:20:56.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 开始行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.38,0:20:57.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,植入追踪器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tag him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.46,0:20:59.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我用不着这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I don't need this. Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.42,0:21:00.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这你用得着 没得商量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you do. It's non-negotiable.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.96,0:21:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我会随便放你走\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I'm letting you go in cold?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.92,0:21:04.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这太老套了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This gets old.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.30,0:21:06.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我爷儿们点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man the fuck up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.30,0:21:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪天你试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try it some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.47,0:21:10.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 这主意不错 你什么时候想退休\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds good, boss man. Any time you want to retire…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.97,0:21:13.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直学着呢 随时能接班\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been takin' notes. I'm ready to step up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.31,0:21:15.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我上哪儿去找你这样的技术天才\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where am I gonna find another techno-thug as gifted as you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.10,0:21:17.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,天生的怪才\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freak of nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.15,0:21:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 稀有品种\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, very rare.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.40,0:21:24.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这儿 宝贝儿 追踪器正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you are, baby. Transponder's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.16,0:21:28.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像我在你的手臂上\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like having me right on your shoulder.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.91,0:21:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,还想在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where else?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.83,0:21:38.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 别忘了给我们写信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, don't forget to write us. All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.94,0:23:24.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.71,0:23:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put him to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.80,0:26:40.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,7458号犯人安东尼·普尔图斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prisoner 7458. Anthony Portos.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.64,0:26:46.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎你 参加国际监禁中心报到会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to the International Detainee Unit intake.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.98,0:26:48.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是霍布斯监狱长\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Warden Hobbes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.60,0:26:51.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍布斯 马什监狱长在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hobbes. Where's Warden Marsh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.90,0:26:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里没有马什监狱长\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no Warden Marsh.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.95,0:27:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我脑子糊涂 记错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, am I disoriented? ls that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.70,0:27:05.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该就是这样吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess that must be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.41,0:27:08.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也没在运输机上看到有人被杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I didn't see a man killed on a transport helicopter.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.33,0:27:10.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,还被扔出去 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and thrown out either, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.63,0:27:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,普尔图斯先生 你已经报到完毕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Portos, your intake is finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.51,0:27:20.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.84,0:27:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的撤离密码是310275\N{\fnArial\fs30}My evacuation code is 3-1-0-2-7-5.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.85,0:27:26.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,撤离密码？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evacuation code?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.27,0:27:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 撤离密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Evacuation code.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.10,0:27:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我几个数字就让你恢复自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meaning you give me a number and you walk out of here free as a bird?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.82,0:27:37.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我不这么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.82,0:27:44.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然来了 你就是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're here now. And you belong to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.37,0:27:49.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经报到完毕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your intake is finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.91,0:27:52.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 等等 我有撤离密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait… I have an evacuation code!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.04,0:27:54.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,有消息吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.13,0:27:56.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟昨天一样 什么也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Getting a ghost bounce, same as yesterday. I can't find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.09,0:28:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,查了两次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.63,0:28:01.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,再查一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.81,0:28:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,A区所有犯人去巴比伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}All prisoners A-Block proceed to Babylon.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.73,0:28:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,A区所有犯人去巴比伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}All prisoners A-Block to proceed to Babylon.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.75,0:28:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,普尔图斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Portos.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.58,0:29:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴比伦随时都会死人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody's days are numbered in Babylon!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.13,0:29:24.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴比伦 死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Babylon, death, death!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.94,0:29:42.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.99,0:29:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不想死就快付钱 去交点朋友 你需要帮手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go make some friends. You're gonna need them.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.35,0:30:10.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.84,0:30:47.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴着别动 趴着别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay down! Stay down!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.58,0:31:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,新来的 你死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}New fish. We own you!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.33,0:31:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back off!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.05,0:31:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后警告\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.60,0:31:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back away.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.06,0:31:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,普尔图斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Portos.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.90,0:31:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛特梅耶 埃米尔·洛特梅耶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rottmayer. Emil Rottmayer.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.53,0:31:51.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在没有心情跟你握手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really not much in a hand-shaking mood right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.24,0:31:54.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.87,0:31:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.62,0:32:00.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,第四个火枪手 真是个好名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fourth Musketeer. It's a good name.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.63,0:32:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么会进来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.21,0:32:09.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你关心这干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you care?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.63,0:32:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前保护过一个人叫曼海姆的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to work security for a guy by the name of Manheim.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.64,0:32:17.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,维克多·曼海姆 听说过这个人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Victor Manheim. Have you heard of the name?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.31,0:32:21.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,曼海姆 我想想 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Manheim, let me see… No.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.27,0:32:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他是个天才 - 是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's a genius. - Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.40,0:32:28.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他这个人有个习惯 喜欢劫富济贫\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has this habit of taking money from the rich and giving it to the poor.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.44,0:32:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你听说过那故事吗 - 对 我听说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You've heard that story before… - I've heard that story. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.99,0:32:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们想找到他 可我不会帮他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now they're trying to find him. But I'm not gonna help them.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.83,0:32:39.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 - 去他们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. - So fuck 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.41,0:32:42.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 去他们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Fuck 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.96,0:32:48.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,普尔图斯 别被弄死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Portos, don't get killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.42,0:32:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.63,0:32:51.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,上回他们弄死个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last time they killed a guy in here,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.42,0:32:55.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,把尸体扔在这儿烂了三天\N{\fnArial\fs30}they let his body rot for three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.22,0:33:00.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 害得监狱舞会都取消了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they canceled the prison dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.65,0:33:08.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不想毁了舞会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wouldn't want to fuck up the prom.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.99,0:33:15.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上好 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morning, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.54,0:33:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,又是件美丽的作品\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's another beautiful piece, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.58,0:33:26.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你骗了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lied to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.50,0:33:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我骗了你？我不知道 - 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I lied to you? I'm not sure what… - No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.71,0:33:32.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You say nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.88,0:33:37.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀掉的那个人我怎么跟客户交代\N{\fnArial\fs30}What am I supposed to tell the client about the man you killed?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.18,0:33:41.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,说是他自己跳下去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That he justjumped, like you said?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.43,0:33:46.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能这么随便 人家出钱让我们防止他跳下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't a free-for-all. We're paid to prevent him from jumping.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.69,0:33:50.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在死人身上可找不到生存证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I can't get proof of life from a dead man.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.53,0:33:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.90,0:33:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙值的钱就从你工资里扣\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will be docked the entire price of the asset.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.70,0:34:01.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙值的钱 相当于我一个月的工资呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}The entire price of the asset equals a month of my pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.74,0:34:05.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,算你运气好 死掉的这个人不是很值钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you're lucky the man you killed was not high value.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.62,0:34:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 德雷克\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is all, Drake.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.00,0:34:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,普尔图斯 看看他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Portosl Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.67,0:34:55.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有日出 没有日落 可他们 还是一直在祈祷\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no sunrise, no sunset, but still they pray all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.97,0:34:58.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不觉得这很有意思吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you find that interesting?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.18,0:35:00.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.51,0:35:04.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你像是那种容易对事情感兴趣的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look like the kind of a guy that finds things interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.47,0:35:06.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前坐过牢吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've done time before?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.14,0:35:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干嘛问这么多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why all the questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.52,0:35:12.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样我能了解你\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how I learn things.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.61,0:35:14.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是去研究其他人吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really ought to study somebody else.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.86,0:35:17.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,普尔图斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Portos!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.49,0:35:20.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,要帮忙吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Need a favor?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.49,0:35:24.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真热心\N{\fnArial\fs30}The favor man.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.91,0:36:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘴上说不感兴趣 可你却一直在观察\N{\fnArial\fs30}For a man who is not interested, you're doing a lot of looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.67,0:36:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you need?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.84,0:36:18.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要到隔离区里去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to get into the isolation area.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.51,0:36:21.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你不会想去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you really don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.09,0:36:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我一定要去 就当是帮个忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I really do. Call it a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.22,0:36:28.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.23,0:36:32.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.06,0:36:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.07,0:36:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这叫帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a favor?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.78,0:36:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候打你是帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes favors hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.70,0:36:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.24,0:36:47.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来吧 - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.08,0:36:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,看你多大能耐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see what you can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.79,0:36:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,行啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.63,0:36:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这家伙是吃素的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hit like a vegetarian.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.63,0:37:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.76,0:37:06.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 - 让我瞧瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right. - Let's see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.47,0:37:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你瞧这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try this.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.18,0:37:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,疼吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.27,0:37:13.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,打得不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was good.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.81,0:37:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有更厉害的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look what's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.65,0:37:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,放松点 这是假打\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax. It's pretend.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.12,0:37:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是本性难移\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess boys will be boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.66,0:37:32.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.33,0:37:39.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他们关进禁闭箱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put them in the box! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.80,0:37:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用急着谢我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can thank me later.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.22,0:38:35.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们知道他有追踪器\N{\fnArial\fs30}They knew he was tagged.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.93,0:38:38.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们当然知道 你当这些是什么人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course they knew. Who do you think these guys are?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.19,0:38:41.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为他们是联邦监狱局的那些傻帽吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think, they're a bunch of yahoos from one of those BOP facilities?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.69,0:38:46.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是帮搞情报的 追踪器都是他们发明的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the shadow world. These guys, they invented this shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.74,0:38:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们干嘛付这么多钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you think they pay us all that money?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.91,0:38:50.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想行动指南\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember what the guidelines were.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.20,0:38:53.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈在说什么？哪有什么行动指南\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck are you talking about? There are no guidelines.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.20,0:38:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 马上打给中情局的婊子 - 哈什\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now, you call that CIA bitch. - Hush…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.33,0:39:01.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Motherfucker.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.88,0:39:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,行啊 我会打的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. I'll make the call.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.84,0:39:12.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾碧盖尔 麻烦你让他离我远点 行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abigail, you got to keep him away from me, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.07,0:39:30.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,胳膊给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me your arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.23,0:40:05.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个医生在这种地方怎么工作？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How does a doctor work in a place like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.11,0:40:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是希望这儿没有医生吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you prefer there wasn't a doctor here?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.44,0:40:09.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is "here"?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.78,0:40:14.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 医生 动作快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Doc, let's wrap it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.97,0:40:35.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doc…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.64,0:40:37.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你问你什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did he ask you?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.47,0:40:40.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他…\N{\fnArial\fs30}He…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.81,0:40:45.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想知道自己 脱水的情况跟别人比起来算不算严重\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wanted to know how his dehydration compared to the other detainees.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.94,0:40:48.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么跟他说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what did you tell him?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.32,0:40:49.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,关我屁事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.61,0:40:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是这么说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I told him.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.66,0:40:59.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他带出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him out of there.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.39,0:41:18.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在里面找到要找的东西了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you find what you were looking for in the box?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.15,0:41:29.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有犯人回到牢房 所有犯人回到牢房\N{\fnArial\fs30}All prisoners back to their cells. All prisoners back to their cells.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.08,0:41:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来之前是什么人 普尔图斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who were you before you came in here, Portos?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.92,0:41:52.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直在观察环境 观察所有东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're always watching the room, always watching everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.26,0:41:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你问我以前是干嘛的 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you asking what I used to do? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.55,0:41:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以告诉你 不过你得再帮我个忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you, but I need a little favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.05,0:41:59.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck that.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.22,0:42:01.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不愿意就算了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, don't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.56,0:42:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了 我听着呢 这次要我帮什么忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I'm listening. What's the favor this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.23,0:42:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要一块金属 大约3英寸宽\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need a piece of metal, about three inches wide.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.86,0:42:10.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,圆的 光滑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Round, smooth.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.19,0:42:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题 我去趟五金店 一会儿就回来 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No problem. I'll hit the Home Depot, and I'll be right back. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.36,0:42:21.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你弄到这样的金属 我也许能把你弄出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you get me that piece of metal, I might be able to get you out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.08,0:42:31.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉霍布斯我想谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell Hobbes I want to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.59,0:42:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,犯人准备接受审讯 犯人准备接受审讯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Interrogation, ready for inmate. Interrogation, ready for inmate.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.39,0:42:41.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这儿已经六个月了 洛特梅耶先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been here six months now, Mr. Rottmayer.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.72,0:42:46.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我们的规矩\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you know how this works.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.94,0:42:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你10秒钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ten seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.23,0:42:55.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,维克多·曼海姆在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is Victor Manheim?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.78,0:42:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,对很多人来说 他是个英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, to many people, he is a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.57,0:42:59.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,9秒钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nine seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.32,0:43:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这儿有纸和笔吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have a pencil and a piece of paper?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.78,0:43:03.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,8秒钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eight seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.45,0:43:04.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你画张地图\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could draw you a map.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.29,0:43:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么地图？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of what?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.46,0:43:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到他的地图\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where you could find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.63,0:43:23.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我小的时候一直想当个艺术家\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I was a kid, I always wanted to be an artist.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.26,0:43:25.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐 你的脸皮还真厚\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God, you are pushing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.27,0:43:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题是我没那个天分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Problem was, I had no talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.10,0:43:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有6秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Six seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.44,0:43:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我试了又试 试了又试 试了又试\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried and I tried and I tried…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.19,0:43:34.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,5秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.32,0:43:36.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有梦想吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you ever have dreams?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.82,0:43:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,4秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.94,0:43:39.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是你一直就想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or did you always want to be…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.53,0:43:40.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 当这个？- 2秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}- this? - Two…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.66,0:43:42.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 1秒 - 画好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- One… - Done.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.95,0:43:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧 在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look. There.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.50,0:43:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.17,0:43:55.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没天分\N{\fnArial\fs30}No talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.55,0:44:01.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,资料显示你这个人智商很高\N{\fnArial\fs30}The records indicate that you are a highly intelligent man.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.68,0:44:05.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果真是这样我希望你能认清现实\N{\fnArial\fs30}As such, I would have expected you to see the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.45,0:44:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,看清现在的局势\N{\fnArial\fs30}and understand it for what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.02,0:44:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里你什么也控制不了 任人摆布\N{\fnArial\fs30}In here, you have no control over any part of your life,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.19,0:44:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}except your breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.35,0:44:15.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在连这点特权也没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you just lost that privilege.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.19,0:44:16.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他放倒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him down!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.06,0:44:53.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.86,0:45:00.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.28,0:45:44.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,出了什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.07,0:45:47.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么 我还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing. I'm still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.41,0:45:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该告诉我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now it's your turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.96,0:45:58.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这个人以越狱为生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I break out of prisons for a living.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.09,0:46:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去八年里\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the past eight years,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.38,0:46:03.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我用越狱的方法 为联邦监狱局测试监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been breaking out of facilities for the Federal Bureau of Prisons.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.47,0:46:08.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍布斯可能利用了我的报告 把这里设计得牢不可破\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think Hobbes used my reports to make this place unbreakable.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.97,0:46:12.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人要测试这里 其实这是个圈套\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone wanted this place tested, but it was a set-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.93,0:46:16.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们想让我消失 不知道是谁 我会查出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}They wanted to bury me. I don't know who, but I'm gonna find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.98,0:46:19.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你再搞个烟雾弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to set up another diversion.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.65,0:46:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.98,0:46:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得再回禁闭箱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got to go back in the box.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.32,0:46:25.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,门儿都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No fucking way.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.70,0:46:27.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,想出去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Want to get outta here?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.49,0:46:32.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我干\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.37,0:46:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,可如果我出不去 我宰了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if I don't get out, I kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.00,0:46:41.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,很公平\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fair enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.67,0:46:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,一次成功的越狱需要具备三个条件\N{\fnArial\fs30}A successful breakout depends on three things,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.17,0:46:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,布局 规律 和帮手\N{\fnArial\fs30}layout, routine, and help.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.38,0:46:49.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可这些我们一样也没有 - 暂时没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But they've taken those away. - For now.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.18,0:46:52.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,禁闭箱底下有东西 可能是水管\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's something under the box. I think it's a conduit.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.47,0:46:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果是 你怎么知道它通向哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it is, how do you know where it goes?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.52,0:47:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 不过我会搞清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't. But I'm gonna find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.19,0:47:07.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,太恶心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's disgusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.20,0:47:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,被囚禁的人跟外面的人思考方式不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}The mind of a man confined works differently than someone on the outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.37,0:47:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,看东西角度不同 整个建筑是垂直的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He sees things different. The architecture is vertical.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.41,0:47:19.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,牢房区 巴比伦 禁闭箱 餐厅\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cell blocks, Babylon, the box, the mess…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.42,0:47:22.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有地方都是巨大的垂直隔间\N{\fnArial\fs30}E verything's in large vertical compartments.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.17,0:47:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,最大的可能 是这地方建在一个地下的天然地峡或者洞穴里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Best guess is they built out underground in large natural fissures and caves.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.72,0:47:34.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,在垂直结构里 禁闭箱下面的东西七成可能是向上的\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a vertical structure, 70/30 says whatever's under that box goes up.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.22,0:47:36.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我能进去 顺着它走\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I can get in there, follow where it goes,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.34,0:47:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许就能到地面上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just might find my way to the surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.23,0:47:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,假设你是对的 怎么切开金属地板\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's say you're right. How do we cut metal?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.69,0:47:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用切开 完全用不着\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't cut. We don't cut at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.94,0:47:49.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个地方在地下 空气很潮湿\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place is subterranean. There's moisture in the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.24,0:47:51.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,造这地方的人应该用铝铆钉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoever built this place should have used aluminum rivets.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.74,0:47:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,来固定面板 可他们用了钢钉\N{\fnArial\fs30}to hold those panels down, but they used steel.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.33,0:47:55.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,钢钉时间久了会生锈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steel rusts over time.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.25,0:48:01.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就利用这一点 把热量都集中到那些钢钉上\N{\fnArial\fs30}We apply that. We'll concentrate the heat to those rivets.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.29,0:48:04.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,让它们膨胀 然后自己脱落\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they'll expand and snap right the fuck off.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.13,0:48:06.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,集中热量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Concentrated heat?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.71,0:48:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 用你给我的那块金属\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, from the piece of metal you gave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.26,0:48:12.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,把用牙膏磨炼的金属对着阳光\N{\fnArial\fs30}You expose a toothpaste-polished piece of metal to sunlight…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.93,0:48:18.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,在100摄氏度的高温下 钢会膨胀0.03立方厘米\N{\fnArial\fs30}At a hundred degrees centigrade, steel expands.03 cubic centimeters.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.93,0:48:21.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些钢钉就会自己脱落\N{\fnArial\fs30}and those rivets are gonna come right off.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.73,0:48:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.77,0:48:26.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你看上去没那么聪明 - 你也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You don't look that smart. - You don't either.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.15,0:48:29.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,大部分监狱都造在小城镇附近\N{\fnArial\fs30}So most prisons are built around small towns.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.61,0:48:33.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管有多偏远 他们需要物资补给和劳动力\N{\fnArial\fs30}No matter how remote, they need supplies and a work force.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.49,0:48:34.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我能到达地面\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I can get to the surface,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.95,0:48:37.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就能知道怎样才能翻过围墙离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll know what it's going to take to get over the wall, get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.58,0:48:40.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过你得在禁闭箱里转移他们的注意力\N{\fnArial\fs30}But first I'm gonna need that diversion in the box.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.96,0:48:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要多少时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much time do you need?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.79,0:48:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,3到5分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three to five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.80,0:48:51.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.15,0:49:13.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Step back.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.16,0:49:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.53,0:49:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认识个鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know shit, you cunt-eater.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.79,0:49:24.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now step back.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.29,0:49:25.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我想起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.63,0:49:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.29,0:49:30.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妈妈 她是我在马拉喀什最喜欢的妓女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mother, she was my favorite whore in Marrakesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.30,0:49:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 她的技术真不赖啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, she could polish a helmet!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.58,0:50:09.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.26,0:50:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.79,0:51:32.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我快要死了 我快要死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're killing me! You're killing me!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.63,0:51:34.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是4号箱的画面 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bringing up box four, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.64,0:51:46.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他又想干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, what is he up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.65,0:51:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 给我闭嘴 你这个德国狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Shut the fuck up, you German dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.49,0:52:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,总控制室 请指示\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master control, please advise.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:10.62,0:52:13.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,稳住他 等我过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just hold him till I get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.46,0:52:18.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,2号箱摄像头故障\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got a camera malfunction, box two.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.30,0:52:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到 重启一下系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roger that. Just reboot the system.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.39,0:52:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.86,0:52:39.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut the fuck up!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.86,0:52:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 洛特梅耶 闭嘴 - 要麻醉他吗 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, Rottmayer, shut up! - Restrain and drug him, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.37,0:52:47.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.68,0:53:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,把4号箱的灯关了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lights off, box four.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.23,0:53:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,把门打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now open it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.07,0:53:26.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天不太顺呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rough day, Mr. Rottmayer?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.91,0:55:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.16,0:55:39.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好好听着 我无所谓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's what you should know. I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.21,0:55:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你早晚会把我想知道的告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sooner or later you will tell me what I want to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.79,0:55:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是必然的 就像死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is inevitable. Like dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.71,0:55:48.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过记住 将来会有一天 我会对你和你现在做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But know this, there will come a point where I don't give a shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.05,0:55:53.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些破事完全不放在心上\N{\fnArial\fs30}about you or whatever the fuck you think you're doing right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.55,0:55:56.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你愉快 洛特梅耶先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}So have a lovely day, Mr. Rottmayer.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.93,0:56:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二层出现紧急情况 第二层出现紧急情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Emergency personnel to level two. Emergency personnel to level two.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.10,0:56:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二层出现紧急情况 长官 电气故障\N{\fnArial\fs30}Valve breach on level two, sir. Electrical malfunction.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.15,0:56:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.78,0:56:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,把货弄出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the assets out of there.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.29,0:57:00.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,快开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open up!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.76,0:57:13.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,快把门打开 快开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open the fucking door! Open the door!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.66,0:57:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 成功了吗 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you make it? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.00,0:57:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.50,0:57:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们在哪儿 - 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where are we? - I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.00,0:57:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.13,0:57:48.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们冻结了支票\N{\fnArial\fs30}They froze the check.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.17,0:57:49.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we talking about here?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.50,0:57:51.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,给雷的费用 他们冻结了支票\N{\fnArial\fs30}The payment for Ray's services. They froze the check.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.88,0:57:56.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有冻结 延迟兑现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not frozen, it's on hold. All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.30,0:57:58.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,250万的大额交易 出现这种情况很正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's very common in a $2.5 million transaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.72,0:58:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 正常情况下只要一周或者十天\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Common would be a week, maybe 10 days.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.44,0:58:02.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一次时间太长了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This has been way longer than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.81,0:58:05.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,天呐 艾碧 这是联邦政府\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus, Abby. It's the federal government.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.65,0:58:09.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道他们的做法\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know how they work.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.32,0:58:10.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,联系过那女人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you call that woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.36,0:58:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 联系过了 一切正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I called. Everything is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.53,0:58:13.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.20,0:58:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在做他该做的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is on the job that he was hired to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.53,0:58:19.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的意思是一切顺利\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're saying it's all good?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.00,0:58:24.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切顺利\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all good.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.37,0:58:26.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,缺口在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where was the breach?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.37,0:58:29.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,缺口在右舷的压载舱系统里\N{\fnArial\fs30}The auxiliary ballast tank system on the starboard side.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.34,0:58:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,5号和7号隔断被打开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Compartments five and seven have been compromised.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.55,0:58:35.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们连接到2号箱底下的通风井\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that leads to the ventilation shaft under box two.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.05,0:58:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,普尔图斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Portos.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.73,0:58:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,铆钉都生锈了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, they're full of rust.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.32,0:58:55.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,准是被水压冲上来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Water pressure must have snapped them clean off.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.91,0:58:59.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.79,0:59:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不叫普尔图斯吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Portos isn't his name, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.75,0:59:09.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么没人提醒我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why wasn't I alerted?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.42,0:59:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 是这样的 很多人出钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, it's like this. There's a lot of people paying money.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.59,0:59:14.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,测试监狱是不是牢不可破\N{\fnArial\fs30}to make sure that facility is unbreakable.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.59,0:59:17.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是雷·布雷斯林 逃脱大师雷·布雷斯林\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Ray Breslin. The great Ray Breslin.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.47,0:59:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他去那儿 就是为了证明连他也逃不出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's there to prove that not even he can get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.14,0:59:23.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定要他永远待在那儿 有问题吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You make sure he stays there forever. Do you have a problem with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.93,0:59:28.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 完全不成问题 尽管放心\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Not at all. Just the opposite.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.35,0:59:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fucker.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.44,0:59:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 还有一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, good. There's one more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.94,0:59:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,中国的银行已经加入了巴西 俄罗斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Chinese banks have joined the Brazilians, the Russians,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.57,0:59:39.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,英国 美国 还有瑞士的银行\N{\fnArial\fs30}the English, the U.S. and the Swiss banks.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.91,0:59:43.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们出钱调查曼海姆那家伙的下落\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're all paying to find out the whereabouts of this Manheim fellow.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.95,0:59:46.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,有传言说他开发了一个程序\N{\fnArial\fs30}Word on the street is that he has developed a program.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.41,0:59:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,要摧毁全世界的银行系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}to turn the entire world banking system into fucking confetti.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.58,0:59:53.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛特梅耶跟那个混蛋一起工作过 他知道曼海姆在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rottmayer worked with that asshole. He knows where he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.17,0:59:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的任务就是撬开他的嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your job is to get that information out of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.84,0:59:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么这么巧 自从布雷斯林和洛特梅耶越走越近\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, itjust so happens that since Breslin has gotten closer to Rottmayer,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.97,1:00:04.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛特梅耶现在的反抗情绪比以前高的多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rottmayer has developed a new edge to his defiance that wasn't there before.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.81,1:00:07.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这都是布雷斯林的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think Breslin is to blame.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.10,1:00:09.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就击垮布雷斯林\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then break Breslin.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.64,1:00:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.98,1:00:15.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个任务交给你 你一定会喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have an assignment I know you'll enjoy.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.01,1:00:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,站起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get on your feet!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.35,1:00:54.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒醒 醒醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wakey, wakey…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.49,1:01:04.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我说说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.53,1:01:07.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,坚强点 你必须战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. You must fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.04,1:01:10.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.66,1:01:11.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我站好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay on your feet!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.00,1:01:13.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们在船上 应该有感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we're on a ship, we would know.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.75,1:01:14.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.88,1:01:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是条1000英尺长200英尺高的船 有稳定性\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not if it was 1, 000 feet long, 200 feet high, with stabilizers.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.21,1:01:21.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们什么也感觉不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}We wouldn't know a damn thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.05,1:01:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,醒醒 醒醒 让他站起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wakey, wakey! Get him on his feet.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.56,1:01:39.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你能行的 - 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You can do it. Keep going. - Come on, go. Move it!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.07,1:01:41.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要坚持住 - 我们出不去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.40,1:01:42.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们能出去 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, we can. - No!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.70,1:01:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我站起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get on your feet!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.41,1:01:49.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须要坚强\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got to stay strong.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.74,1:01:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,退后 退后 我让你快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back up! Back up! It's you I want. Move it!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.75,1:01:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,人渣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Piece of shit…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.98,1:02:17.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手 德雷克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it now, Drake.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.96,1:02:38.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要投降 别让他们打垮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't give up. Don't let them break you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.50,1:02:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么想在监狱里过日子\N{\fnArial\fs30}What made you want to spend your life in prison?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.76,1:02:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我 是因为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me. What made you do it?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.01,1:02:51.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.65,1:03:02.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前是律师 是检察官\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was a lawyer. Prosecutor.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.65,1:03:07.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个被我送进监狱的人发誓要报复我\N{\fnArial\fs30}A man lput away made a promise to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.20,1:03:11.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,在牢里的三年 他天天都在计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}This man thought about that promise every day for three years,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.49,1:03:14.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,计划怎样逃出监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}planning his way out of prison,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.50,1:03:18.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,计划将来怎么报复我\N{\fnArial\fs30}planning on how he was gonna keep his word.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.21,1:03:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,被人夺走性命不算什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taking a man's life is nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.67,1:03:28.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,等于夺走一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's everything, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.85,1:03:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.15,1:03:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,光把坏人送进监狱是不够的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, putting people in prison wasn't good enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.82,1:03:51.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须确保他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I had to… lwanted to.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.87,1:03:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远待在里面 逃不出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}make sure they stayed in there, didn't get out.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.58,1:03:58.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我理解你 我有个女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand. I have a daughter.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.08,1:04:03.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道那种感受 你有两条路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never forget them. You have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.59,1:04:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以死在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can die in here,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.21,1:04:08.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者跟我一起逃出去 惩罚陷害你的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}or you can get out with me and punish who put you here.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.05,1:04:11.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,听见了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hear me?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.09,1:04:13.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.56,1:04:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.23,1:04:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,有好消息也有坏消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good news and bad news.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.94,1:04:26.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在想那次会面提到的私人监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was thinking about that first meeting, privatized incarceration.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.86,1:04:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不受约束 立足国际 纯粹为了盈利 完全非法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Off the grid, international profile. And I started digging.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.91,1:04:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,有前军队的混蛋和黑市公司的渣滓长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run by ex-military assholes and Blackwater rejects. You know, bad dudes.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.37,1:04:41.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷八成就在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Ray is anywhere, it's here.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.25,1:04:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里是哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is "here"?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.58,1:04:45.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是坏消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the bad news.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.21,1:04:48.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.10,1:04:57.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞不到这里的布局图\N{\fnArial\fs30}No access to any layout.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.89,1:05:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,警卫没有盲点\N{\fnArial\fs30}No blind times.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.23,1:05:06.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们被困在该死的海中央\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're in the middle of the fucking ocean.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.48,1:05:09.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我好歹摸清了这儿的规律\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'll be damned if I didn't find a routine.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.40,1:05:12.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们故意弄混警卫的班次 每次都不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}They scramble the guard shifts so they're never the same.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.61,1:05:17.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是他们没法改变警卫自己的习惯\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they can't change the routine of the guards themselves.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.78,1:05:21.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不知道警卫几时上班几时下班\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't know when they start. We don't know when they end.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.16,1:05:24.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我知道他们按照习惯会做些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I do know where they're gonna be based on habit.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.79,1:05:28.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到那个下楼的家伙吗？发现他走路内八字吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}See that guy coming down the stairs? See how he walks all pigeon-toed?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.80,1:05:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,鸭子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Duck.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.84,1:05:33.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 鸭子一直跟那个爱挠脖子的家伙搭档\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. The Duck always works with the guy scratching the back of his neck.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.97,1:05:35.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮炎男\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hives.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.43,1:05:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 皮炎男\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Hives.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.93,1:05:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这两个人搭档的时候总是绕圈巡逻\N{\fnArial\fs30}When Duck and Hives work together, they always do a circle.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.18,1:05:43.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会不定时地巡逻\N{\fnArial\fs30}They may do it at random times of day. It doesn't matter when they do it,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.94,1:05:48.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,但总是在第128步的时候走完一圈 然后这俩人分开 看着\N{\fnArial\fs30}it always ends up being 128 strides, then they split up. Watch.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.15,1:05:51.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 他们各走一边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now they each take a side.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.36,1:05:55.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,鸭子走63步 皮炎男走65步 到顶上会合\N{\fnArial\fs30}Duck walks 63 strides, Hives 65. Then they meet up at the top.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.87,1:06:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,底下那个五大三粗的家伙 他动得不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}The guard down there at the bottom, the heavy-set guy, he doesn't move much.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.62,1:06:04.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜他在这儿时间比较长 懒得到处走\N{\fnArial\fs30}My guess is he's been here a while and only does what he has to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.46,1:06:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,路易莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Louisa.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.04,1:06:08.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,路易莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Louisa?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.21,1:06:10.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的肥屁股让我想起我第一个女朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}His fat ass reminds me of my first girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.67,1:06:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.51,1:06:16.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边那个警卫是个麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}That guard over there could be a problem for us.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.01,1:06:18.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一直东看西看\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's always looking around.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.35,1:06:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小鸡男 - 小鸡男 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The Chicken Man. - Chicken Man, right.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.02,1:06:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜小鸡男是新来的 干活一丝不苟\N{\fnArial\fs30}My guess, Chickie's new here. Does everything by the book.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.06,1:06:27.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么知道他们什么时候换班？- 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How do you know when the shift ends? - I don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.48,1:06:33.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜这是午饭时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}My guess, it's lunchtime.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.57,1:06:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.37,1:06:39.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.49,1:06:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经摸清了规律\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now that we've got the routine,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.87,1:06:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来缺个好心的医生 我们在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}we just gotta ask the good doctor where the hell we are.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.01,1:06:58.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没权利给你任何止痛药\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not permitted to give you anything for the pain,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.47,1:07:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以别问我要\N{\fnArial\fs30}so don't request it.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.55,1:07:03.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是医生 你宣过誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a doctor. You took an oath.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.93,1:07:06.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愿尽我的能力与判断力所及\N{\fnArial\fs30}"According to my ability and judgment,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.73,1:07:09.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护病人免于伤病 不公\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I'll protect my patients from harm and injustice."
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.24,1:07:19.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这样不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you're doing here is wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.87,1:07:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底想从我这儿得到什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What exactly is it you want from me?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.41,1:07:28.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想知道我在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to know where the hell I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.26,1:07:44.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,警卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guards!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.94,1:07:50.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 不要紧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. It's under control.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.19,1:07:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他放回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put him back here.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.66,1:08:04.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.30,1:08:20.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么样 - 不成\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So… - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.47,1:08:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,再给他点压力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got to push him harder.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.80,1:08:24.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,逼得太紧会有反效果\N{\fnArial\fs30}Push him, we'll lose him.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.80,1:08:26.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,没别的办法了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No other options?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.43,1:08:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有B计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plan B.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.35,1:08:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,总得有个备用计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}You always gotta have a Plan B.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.49,1:08:39.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,弄到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you get it?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.33,1:08:52.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 我需要他的眼镜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I need his glasses.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.07,1:10:08.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官 你来看看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir? You want to take a look at this?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.75,1:10:15.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是什么 - 六分仪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's this? - It's a sextant.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.25,1:10:19.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.79,1:10:22.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,它管用 用它测出海平面和北极星的夹角\N{\fnArial\fs30}It works. You spot the North Star with the horizon.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.92,1:10:25.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过只能得出纬度\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it will only give us half of our location.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.51,1:10:31.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,把布雷斯林带来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring Breslin.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.85,1:10:36.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会解释怎么用 但得先把它带到甲板上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll explain how it works later, but first we've got to get it topside.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.27,1:10:37.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch out.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.41,1:10:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎入住你的新家 布雷斯林先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to your new home, Mr. Breslin.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.54,1:10:58.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是E区\N{\fnArial\fs30}Section E.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.54,1:11:01.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,就你一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Waiting for inmates.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.54,1:11:03.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know who I am?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.13,1:11:04.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do now.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.38,1:11:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我仔细研究过你的著作 写得真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've studied your work very closely. It's quite brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.01,1:11:12.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上我就是参考了你的著作\N{\fnArial\fs30}As a matter of fact, it's what I used as a reference guide in.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.77,1:11:14.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,才设计出这座监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}designing this facility.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.06,1:11:16.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然你知道 快放我走\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you know who I am, let me go.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.85,1:11:19.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不 布雷斯林先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no, Mr. Breslin.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.10,1:11:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,事可不是这么办的 这次不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not how this works. Not this time.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.23,1:11:26.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,花钱把你弄进来的人 希望你永远待在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, the people who paid for you to be here want you here forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.15,1:11:29.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道了这点 知道了你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}And knowing that, and knowing who you are,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.16,1:11:32.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你曾经是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}well, who you were…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.08,1:11:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就不能再让你和洛特梅耶\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't have you communicating with Rottmayer,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.45,1:11:38.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者任何其他人说话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}or anybody else, for that matter.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.75,1:11:42.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是现实 你逃不出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the reality. And there's no way out.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.25,1:11:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有两条路\N{\fnArial\fs30}This can go two ways.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.88,1:11:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,放我走 我就当没这回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You let me go and I'll pretend this never happened.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.13,1:11:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不放 等我出去 我会把这该死的地方烧光\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't, and I'll burn this fucking place to the ground on my way out.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.93,1:11:55.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,从现在开始 不许去餐厅 不许放风\N{\fnArial\fs30}Effective right now, no mess, no rec time,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.10,1:11:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有不许洗澡\N{\fnArial\fs30}and no showers.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.60,1:12:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能帮你找到曼海姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can get you Victor Manheim.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.81,1:12:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛特梅耶信任我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rottmayer trusts me.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.40,1:12:07.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,话虽如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you say.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.82,1:12:09.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,可这还不够\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not good enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.95,1:12:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么损失？找到曼海姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have you got to lose? Finding him has got to be worth.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.12,1:12:14.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能拿到的钱比我值的钱要多得多吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}a lot more than what you were paid for me, right, Hobbes?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.78,1:12:16.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个主意不错 不过\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a nice idea, but.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.54,1:12:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,按照现在的情况 这两份钱我都要\N{\fnArial\fs30}as it stands right now, I'm in line to get both.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.79,1:12:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你永远打不垮洛特梅耶 他死也不会说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll never break Rottmayer. He'll die before he turns.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.04,1:12:28.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只有靠我才能得到你想要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm your only chance to get what you want.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.43,1:12:37.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要曼海姆和整个组织的信息 名字 目前的位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want Manheim and his whole network. Names. Locations in real time.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.89,1:12:41.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果情报属实我就放你走 不过记住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get that. If it checks out, I'll let you go. But know this.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.27,1:12:43.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须把洛特梅耶跟你说的每一个字都告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tell me every word that you and Rottmayer share,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.06,1:12:47.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则我就亲手宰了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}or I will personally pull the fucking life out of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.86,1:12:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,很公平\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fair enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.83,1:12:57.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.41,1:12:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打的你这张牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm playing you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.21,1:13:03.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨天晚上洛特梅耶告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last night Rottmayer told me he started his network.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.79,1:13:06.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,曼海姆和他的五个同乡创办了这个组织\N{\fnArial\fs30}with five guys from his hometown.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.25,1:13:09.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说他可以把命交给他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said he could trust his life to these guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.71,1:13:11.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,把六分仪给贾韦德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give Javed the sextant.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.76,1:13:14.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他怎么用 说我们能帮他出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show him how to use it. Tell him it's his ticket outta here.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.68,1:13:17.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,贾韦德 他宁可看我们死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Javed. He'd rather see us dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.56,1:13:19.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们绝不会怀疑贾韦德\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll be the last one they suspect.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.60,1:13:20.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,曼海姆吹嘘过他的组织\N{\fnArial\fs30}He bragged how his network.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.81,1:13:23.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,六年前如何让冰岛的银行倒闭\N{\fnArial\fs30}caused the bank collapse in Iceland six years ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.81,1:13:27.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,六年前的事情管我屁事 我要知道他现在在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't give a shit about six years ago. I want to know where he is now.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.38,1:13:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想死吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to die?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.17,1:13:51.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想出去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to get out?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.64,1:13:59.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.35,1:14:03.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人在密谋越狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're plotting an escape.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.98,1:14:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,越狱？\N{\fnArial\fs30}An escape?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.44,1:14:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗 谁 什么时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really? Who and when?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.52,1:14:10.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,全部的细节我不清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know all the details.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.82,1:14:12.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,只知道一些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just some.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.94,1:14:15.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你知道的告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, tell me the details you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.66,1:14:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得先给我点好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}You give me things first.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.25,1:14:28.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿尔弗雷德 阿尔弗雷德先生 管你叫什么名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Alfredo, Afridi, or whatever the fuck your name is…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.84,1:14:33.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那些贩毒集团的朋友们花了很多钱 把你送到这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your opium drug cartel friends have paid a lot of money for you to be here.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.26,1:14:38.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是当然的 那些混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course they did, those fucks.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.14,1:14:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你除了想要自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}So aside from your freedom,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.77,1:14:44.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}what else can I give you?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.18,1:14:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要那些警卫别去管我的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want the guards to leave my people alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.19,1:14:49.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的牢房里\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Holy Koran…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.36,1:14:53.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,要有一本可兰经\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want one in my cell.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.90,1:14:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要在室外说真主\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I want to say the name of Allah.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.95,1:15:00.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,和先知穆罕默德的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the prophet Mohammed in the open air.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.04,1:15:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要做晚祷的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to be seen by my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.58,1:15:08.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,真主能够看见我\N{\fnArial\fs30}when I say my evening prayers.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.71,1:15:10.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.46,1:15:12.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.42,1:15:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要真主能看见我 霍布斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to be seen by my God, Mr. Hobbes!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.80,1:17:19.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,纬度是30度22分\N{\fnArial\fs30}30 degrees, 22 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.38,1:17:22.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在回归线无风带\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're in Horse Latitudes, calm water.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.13,1:17:24.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,北还是南\N{\fnArial\fs30}North or south?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.30,1:17:27.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,赤道上方的水流是逆时针方向 所以是北面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Water goes counter-clockwise above the equator, so we're north.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.56,1:17:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么弄到经度\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do we get the longitude?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.89,1:17:33.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨天进来一个新犯人 他说昨天是11月20号\N{\fnArial\fs30}They brought a new fish in yesterday. He said it was November 20th.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.40,1:17:38.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,11月的海上有温暖的雨水和空气\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got warm rain, warm air at sea in November.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.98,1:17:40.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,想象你要造一个秘密监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you're building a secret facility.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.61,1:17:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把它放在海上\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're putting it on the water.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.53,1:17:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你选择北纬30度 因为你想避开大风大浪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're at 30 degrees north latitude because you want to avoid rough water.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.41,1:17:51.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会选加勒比海和太平洋\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're going to want to stay away from the Caribbean and the Pacific,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.37,1:17:53.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者中国海的东边\N{\fnArial\fs30}say, east of the China Sea.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.79,1:17:59.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我敢打赌 我们很可能在摩洛哥的沿海\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I was a betting man, I'd say we could be off the coast of Morocco.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.67,1:18:02.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你只是猜测 - 国际水域 风平浪静\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's just a guess. - International waters. Calm sea.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.88,1:18:06.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,离陆地很近 方便补给 这是有根据的推测\N{\fnArial\fs30}Close enough to land for supplies. Educated guess.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.47,1:18:09.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在卡萨布兰卡认识个人 他欠我个大人情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know a guy in Casablanca. He owes me big-time.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.14,1:18:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,大到能来救你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough to come and get you?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.93,1:18:14.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,救我还不够呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'd still owe me.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.98,1:18:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,就一个办法能把消息发出去 就一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's only one way to get a message out. One way.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.61,1:18:23.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.95,1:18:31.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么 你吞了止血粉\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this? You swallowed clotting powder?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.71,1:18:41.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍布斯的办公室里有本书\N{\fnArial\fs30}In Hobbes' office is a book.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.75,1:18:45.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷·布雷斯林写的 破解监狱安防系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}Compromising Correctional Institution Security by Ray Breslin.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.84,1:18:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,第88页上 有路易斯堡联邦监狱C区牢房的详细介绍\N{\fnArial\fs30}On page 88 is a detailed description of Cell Block C at Lewisburg Federal Prison.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.27,1:18:53.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,警卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guards!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.85,1:18:56.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去看看 想想你的誓言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check it out. And remember your oath.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.32,1:19:04.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拖不住霍布斯了 得告诉他个位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't stall Hobbes anymore. I've got to give him a location.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.40,1:19:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我们还没计划好\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we still don't have a plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.49,1:19:08.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就看医生的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's in the doctor's hands.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.96,1:20:04.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,医务人员请去三楼审讯室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Medical personnel, Interrogation Three.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.13,1:20:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,警卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guards!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.05,1:20:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,把E区的犯人普尔图斯带过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring me prisoner Portos from E Block.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.68,1:20:13.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,是霍布斯的命令 快去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hobbes' orders. Do it now.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.19,1:20:23.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,吸气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Breathe in.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.57,1:20:29.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,再吸一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Again.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.49,1:20:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看了那本书 你怎么知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw the book. How did you know?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.74,1:20:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,那本书就是我写的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Ray Breslin. lwrote the book.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.50,1:20:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,医生是这样一群人 对他们开的药所知不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctors are men who prescribe medicines of which they know little.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.09,1:20:53.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,对这药治疗的疾病所知更少\N{\fnArial\fs30}to cure diseases of which they know less.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.51,1:20:56.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,而对 用药的人更是一无所知\N{\fnArial\fs30}for men of whom they know nothing at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.60,1:21:03.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要我做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want me to do?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.11,1:21:16.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,医生搞定了 贾韦德该行动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The doctor is in. Now Javed has to do his part.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.62,1:21:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,曼海姆的主要行动基地在鲁塞城外20英里的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Manheim's main base of operations is 20 miles outside of Ruse.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.84,1:21:31.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,在保加利亚和罗马尼亚的边界上\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's on the Bulgarian-Romanian border.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.35,1:21:38.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}See?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.10,1:21:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,出卖朋友没你想得那么难\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ratting out your friends ain't so hard.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.02,1:21:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,在霍布斯意识到那个位置是瞎扯之前 我们有24个小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got 24 hours before Hobbes realizes the Bulgarian location is bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.78,1:21:54.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,认识C区的人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who do you know in C Block?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.66,1:22:03.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经允许你半夜做祷告了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've given permission for your midnight prayer,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.25,1:22:05.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要回报我什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}so what do you have for me?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.01,1:22:17.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 镜头对准布雷斯林 - 是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lock in on Breslin. - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.06,1:22:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在干什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we up to?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.15,1:22:28.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,开响\N{\fnArial\fs30}Louder.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.02,1:22:30.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,响一点 再响点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Louder. Louder!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.07,1:22:32.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.11,1:22:38.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上破译\N{\fnArial\fs30}Decode it.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.10,1:23:07.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.82,1:23:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,放大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zoom in.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.73,1:23:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,是玛卡玛·哈桑\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Makmar Hassan.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.53,1:23:22.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,布雷斯林想让哈桑从C区开始越狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Breslin is gonna have Hassan start the break from Cell Block C.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.08,1:23:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道了时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a time frame.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.91,1:23:28.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道了位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we have a location.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.00,1:23:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,C区牢房\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cell Block C.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.80,1:23:38.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,增加三倍警卫 查出所有参与的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Triple the guard force there. I want to know everyone who's involved.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.68,1:23:39.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.80,1:23:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,C区牢房 准备接受检查\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cell Block C, prepare for inspection.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.76,1:23:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,C区牢房 准备接受检查\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cell Block C, prepare for inspection.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.57,1:24:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,只剩路易莎和小鸡男 其他人都被派到C区牢房了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Louisa and Chicken Man. They sent everyone else to Cell Block C.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.70,1:24:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,但愿你是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You better be fuckin' right.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.95,1:24:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,放心吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.04,1:24:13.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 你这个该死的白种穷鬼婊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! You fucking white trash scumbag bitch!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.30,1:24:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,要去哪儿 你这个该死的基地恐怖分子同性恋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you going, you fucking towel-head al-Qaeda faggot?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.01,1:24:19.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你这个该死的秃头 - 去死吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, your fuckin' sister gives… - Fuck you, you diaper-head…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.05,1:24:21.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你这个该死的尿布头 - 狗娘养的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You fuckin' skinhead! - You motherfuckin'…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.64,1:24:30.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,C区并没有人越狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}The break was never happening in Block C.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.03,1:24:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人都去巴比伦 快去\N{\fnArial\fs30}All men from C to Babylon. Right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.30,1:25:03.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.42,1:25:38.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,快上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.84,1:25:43.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,布雷斯林到哪儿去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the fuck is Breslin?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.30,1:25:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,快快快 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go! Let's move!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.74,1:26:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,11分钟内赶到甲板上 但愿医生联系上人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got 11 minutes to get topside. Let's hope the doc made contact.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.29,1:26:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go. Go.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.76,1:26:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.43,1:26:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,摄像头都连在一起 得把它们关掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the cameras are connected. We've gotta block 'em out.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.81,1:26:32.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.19,1:26:41.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,笑一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say "cheese."
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.16,1:26:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.84,1:27:03.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了 就是这儿 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. All right, this is it. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.09,1:27:07.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,启动5号安全协议\N{\fnArial\fs30}Engage security protocol five.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.45,1:27:36.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,是全面封锁 都被锁在里面了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a full lockdown. We're all locked inside.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.04,1:27:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有8分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eight minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.50,1:27:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们没招了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're out of moves.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.58,1:27:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,德雷克 带两队人 把耗子全部抓回笼子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drake, take two units. Drag the rats back to their cages.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.15,1:28:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold up.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.80,1:28:30.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,贾韦德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Javed!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.55,1:28:37.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开3号门 抓住他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open gate three! Take 'em!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.15,1:28:49.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快快快 别让他们跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go, go! Don't fucking lose them!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.32,1:28:55.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,布雷斯林\N{\fnArial\fs30}Breslin!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:56.87,1:29:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,把门打开 你这个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Breslinl Open before I break you, you motherfucker!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.96,1:29:05.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你别想活着出去 你这个狗娘养的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll never get out of here alive, you arsehole!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.34,1:29:08.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我会宰了你 - 我们得快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're gonna kill you! - We've gotta move!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.14,1:29:21.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,把门弄开 我从另一边进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smash that door down. I'll come around from the other side.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:22.06,1:29:24.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们怎么会知道我们在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Breslin, how the hell do they know where we are?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.23,1:29:26.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是把摄像头都关了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You turned off the cameras, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.95,1:29:36.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,运动探测器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Motion detector.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.87,1:29:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.04,1:29:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,让开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.26,1:29:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以玩上一整天 布雷斯林 可一切都在我的控制中\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can play your games all day, Mr. Breslin, but I'm still in control.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.14,1:30:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你做什么都没用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever you do, I have the power.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.31,1:30:03.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你逃不出我的掌心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I own your ass.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.44,1:30:07.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们得爬到梯子上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys have gotta get up that ladder.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.81,1:30:10.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去找轮机舱 把电控关掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got to find the engine room and shut the power grid down.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.28,1:30:12.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,在备用发电机开始工作之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those magnetic locks will stay open for about.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.44,1:30:14.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,有5秒钟的时间 磁力锁是打开的\N{\fnArial\fs30}five seconds before the back-up generator kicks in.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.61,1:30:17.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们只有这点时间出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand? That's all the time you're gonna have.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.29,1:30:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着这个 拿着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take this. Take it.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:25.25,1:30:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a good man.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.46,1:30:28.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.46,1:30:32.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么办 - 我会出去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What about you? - I'll be right behind you.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.21,1:30:33.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,万一你5点还没上甲板呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if you're not on the deck at 5:00?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.76,1:30:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该干嘛干嘛 我还有B计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do what you've got to do. There's always Plan B.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.14,1:30:47.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我走 我们一起出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.77,1:30:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用了 我出不去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're dead men. There's no way out.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.98,1:30:51.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 跟我一起走 - 我爬不上梯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come with me. - I won't make it up that ladder.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.69,1:30:53.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我背你上去 - 我要去拖住他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll carry you up the ladder. - But I can hold them back.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.45,1:30:58.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不会丢下你的 - 把枪给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm not gonna leave you behind. - Give me your gun.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:00.20,1:31:01.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,快把枪给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just give me your gun.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:14.46,1:31:15.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,真主保佑你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Allah be with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.88,1:31:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们上面见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see you up there.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.72,1:31:21.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now go.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.02,1:31:24.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take care.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.04,1:31:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:51.92,1:31:52.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,报告情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Report?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:53.05,1:31:54.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck you, you motherfucker!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.67,1:31:57.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在下甲板受到攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're taking gunfire on the lower deck!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.38,1:32:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他逃到下甲板 一定是去轮机舱\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he made it to the lower deck, he's going to the engine room.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.59,1:32:02.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我在轮机舱会合 我马上下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meet me in the engine room. I'm coming down.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:03.06,1:32:04.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:04.10,1:32:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把那个混蛋弄出来 - 是 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get that fucker out of there! - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:14.44,1:32:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.48,1:33:37.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 随你怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:06.18,1:34:08.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,透不过气来了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Having trouble breathing?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:25.86,1:34:28.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要杀了你 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna fucking kill ya, motherfucker!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:34.66,1:34:35.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back off!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:56.35,1:34:57.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 看见他吗 - 是的 他在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you see him? - Yeah, he's here.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:59.19,1:35:00.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, wait, wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.48,1:35:43.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,它还在左舷 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's still on port, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:47.82,1:35:49.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:54.45,1:35:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 趴下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Get down!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:06.80,1:36:08.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这里有情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a situation up here!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:09.88,1:36:10.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.67,1:36:43.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:49.84,1:36:51.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁都别想离开这艘船\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one gets off this ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:53.18,1:36:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,格杀勿论\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot to kill.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:16.03,1:37:17.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:24.88,1:37:26.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们得赶快走 - 现在还不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We have to go now! - Not yet!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.86,1:37:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,投降吧 布雷斯林先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give yourself up, Mr. Breslin.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:55.95,1:37:58.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以到处跑 弄出点动静\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can run around, make some noise…
Dialogue: 0,1:38:03.29,1:38:05.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,洒点血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spill some blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:05.21,1:38:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,可你出不去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't get out.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.59,1:38:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not really…
Dialogue: 0,1:38:10.59,1:38:14.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你太太和你儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know about your wife, your son.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:18.56,1:38:19.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一清二楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know every detail.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:20.43,1:38:25.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你指出了我作品中的小小不足\N{\fnArial\fs30}So thank you for pointing out all the small flaws in my creation.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:26.44,1:38:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会修正加强\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be sure to fortify them.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:30.40,1:38:32.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你的时间到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But your time's up.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:33.11,1:38:34.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,听见吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hear me?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:35.28,1:38:36.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,布雷斯林\N{\fnArial\fs30}Breslin?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:39.12,1:38:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的时间到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yourtime is up.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:46.62,1:38:50.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面 外面 彻底搜查这个房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one in. No one out. Search every inch of this fucking room.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:51.46,1:38:52.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,重新启动电源\N{\fnArial\fs30}And power this thing back up!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:53.59,1:38:55.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,快上 快上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Let's go, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:25.00,1:39:26.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快起飞 - 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's roll! - Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:55.57,1:39:56.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,布雷斯林\N{\fnArial\fs30}Breslin!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:12.75,1:40:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,下降\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go down!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:19.88,1:40:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 快走 下去 下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, let's go! Down, down!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:40.57,1:40:42.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,危险 我们得赶紧走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna have to back off!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:51.08,1:40:52.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛特梅耶 枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rottmayer! Gun!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:53.88,1:40:55.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 枪 - 把你的枪给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Gun! - Give me your gun!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:37.00,1:41:38.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boom.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:51.02,1:41:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你愉快 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have a lovely day, asshole!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:29.35,1:42:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now what?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:30.47,1:42:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,轻松一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:11.26,1:43:12.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以前见过她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You met her before.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:12.60,1:43:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰西卡·梅耶 很荣幸见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jessica Mayer. It's an honor to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:15.18,1:43:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你代表了这个领域的最高水平\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your work is the gold standard in the field.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:17.19,1:43:19.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是我在中情局里的耳目\N{\fnArial\fs30}She has been my eyes and ears inside the Agency.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:20.06,1:43:21.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:21.40,1:43:23.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,她也是我的女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she's also my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:24.03,1:43:25.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, darling.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:25.86,1:43:27.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢天谢地 你逃出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank God you made it.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:29.07,1:43:30.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好想你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I missed you.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:32.58,1:43:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:33.62,1:43:35.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 没什么 不用担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing. Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:37.75,1:43:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是曼海姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're Manheim.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:42.05,1:43:43.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我居然没想到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't see that coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:43.92,1:43:44.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该想到\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should've.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:44.96,1:43:46.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:50.34,1:43:51.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么做到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd you do it?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:51.68,1:43:53.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有代号\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have code names.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:53.51,1:43:56.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,代号洛特梅耶 表示被关在高度戒备的监狱里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Code name Rottmayer meant maximum security incarceration.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:59.81,1:44:02.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸爸被抓的时候激活了这个代号\N{\fnArial\fs30}When my dad was picked up, it activated the code.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:03.48,1:44:04.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这时候联系了克拉克\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's when you called Les Clark.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:05.19,1:44:08.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要找最好的人 你同意接受这份工作后\N{\fnArial\fs30}I needed the best. And after you agreed to do it,
Dialogue: 0,1:44:12.12,1:44:14.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个名字其实是身份代号\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the name you gave me was the I.D. code.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:14.45,1:44:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,普尔图斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Portos.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:17.29,1:44:19.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛特梅耶 埃米尔·洛特梅耶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rottmayer. Emil Rottmayer.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:19.92,1:44:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我成为你最好的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I became your best friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:25.76,1:44:29.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你合作实在太难了 我可费老劲了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are not user-friendly. I had to work very hard.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:30.30,1:44:33.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有那该死的禁闭箱 真是热死我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that damn box. That was hot.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:33.60,1:44:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得还好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It did get warm, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:35.77,1:44:39.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,无所谓了 重要的是我们现在都出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it doesn't matter. What matters is that I'm out and so are you.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:41.60,1:44:43.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面的日子真够受的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We both served enough time.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:45.40,1:44:47.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们重新来过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to try it again?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:49.24,1:44:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You son-of-a-bitch…
Dialogue: 0,1:44:55.87,1:44:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望不用再见到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope I never see you again.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:57.58,1:44:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好伤心呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}That hurts.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:06.34,1:45:08.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}One more thing!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:09.34,1:45:10.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,克拉克到底知道多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much did Les really know?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:10.84,1:45:13.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,起先只知道我告诉他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only what I told him, at first. But the next thing I know,
Dialogue: 0,1:45:13.80,1:45:14.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 后来我发现他绕开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's gone around me.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:14.97,1:45:16.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,向活人墓的投资人提供服务\N{\fnArial\fs30}and offered his services to the backers of The Tomb.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:16.97,1:45:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他知道我被送到哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he knew where I was being sent?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:19.18,1:45:21.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他安排的运输\N{\fnArial\fs30}He arranged your transport.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:22.77,1:45:23.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,要搭车吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Need a ride?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:24.52,1:45:27.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不了 谢谢 我自己有安排\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, thanks. I made my own arrangements.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:42.12,1:45:44.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情蹊跷 我们感觉很不对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wasn't tracking. We knew something wasn't right.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:45.17,1:45:47.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个地方危机四伏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Red flags going up all over the place.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:47.46,1:45:50.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,克拉克却显得过分淡定 我们就开始调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clark was too calm about it, so we started digging.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:51.05,1:45:52.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来有人想请他做\N{\fnArial\fs30}We found out he'd been offered the CEO job.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:52.72,1:45:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,活人墓项目的首席执行官\N{\fnArial\fs30}of running the whole Tomb program.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:54.30,1:45:56.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果那个样板监狱被证明牢不可破\N{\fnArial\fs30}if the prototype you were buried in proved inescapable.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:56.93,1:45:59.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就能拿到500万年薪和优先认股权\N{\fnArial\fs30}At a salary of $5 million a year, plus stock options.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:59.52,1:46:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,追踪到他了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me you tracked him down.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:00.73,1:46:03.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,照你的吩咐 这会儿行动已经开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like you asked. The plan's in motion as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:16.24,1:46:18.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,该睡觉了 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's sleepy-time, motherfucker.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:33.26,1:46:34.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, fuck!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:37.93,1:46:40.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不 快发动 发动 发动啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no… Come on, come on, come on…
Dialogue: 0,1:46:43.48,1:46:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:45.10,1:46:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ray!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:47.40,1:46:48.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:51.94,1:46:54.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ray!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:59.78,1:47:01.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是哈什 - 他说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's Hush. - What did he say?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:02.83,1:47:04.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切顺利\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all good.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:05.00,1:47:06.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:08.92,1:47:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是什么 - 新工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's that? - Job offers.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:10.25,1:47:13.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚点再看吧 我们一起吃顿特别的晚餐吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe later. Why don't you and me have a very special dinner.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:14.47,1:47:15.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来做饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll cook.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:16.47,1:47:18.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,嫌我遭的罪还不够吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Haven't I suffered enough?
